          "type": "short",
          "difficulty": "easy",
          "stem": "In the diagram, $AOB$ is a straight line and $\\angle AOC = 65^\\circ$. Find the size of $\\angle BOC$.",
          "figure": {
            "geometry": {
              "points": {
                "A": [
                  -2,
                  0
                ],
                "B": [
                  2,
                  0
                ],
                "O": [
                  0,
                  0
                ],
                "C": [
                  -1,
                  1.5
                ]
              },
              "segments": [
                {
                  "from": "A",
                  "to": "B"
                },
                {
                  "from": "O",
                  "to": "C"
                }
              ],
              "angles": [
                {
                  "at": "O",
                  "label": "65^\\circ"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "answer": "115^\\circ",
          "hint": "Angles on a straight line add to 180 degrees.",
          "solution": "Angles on a straight line add to $180^\\circ$. $\\angle BOC = 180^\\circ - 65^\\circ = 115^\\circ$.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "explain": "Angles on a straight line add to \\(180^\\circ\\).",
              "work": "\\angle BOC + 65^\\circ = 180^\\circ"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Subtract \\(65^\\circ\\) from \\(180^\\circ\\).",
              "work": "\\angle BOC = 180^\\circ - 65^\\circ = 115^\\circ"
            }
          ]
        },
