        {
          "id": "y8-5h-q1d",
          "type": "short",
          "difficulty": "easy",
          "stem": "Straight lines $AD$, $BE$ and $CF$ intersect at $O$. If $\\angle AOF = 40^\\circ$ and $\\angle DOE = 65^\\circ$, find the size of $\\angle BOC$.",
          "figure": {
            "geometry": {
              "points": {
                "A": [
                  -2,
                  1
                ],
                "D": [
                  2,
                  -1
                ],
                "B": [
                  -1,
                  2
                ],
                "E": [
                  1,
                  -2
